      "note": "Codebase-wide Dapper CancellationToken gap: all repository implementations (DapperMovieRepository, DapperMovieCatalogRepository, DapperFilterSlotRepository, SpdbConfigRepository) open connections with cancellationToken but do not forward the token to individual Dapper QueryAsync / ExecuteAsync calls. Individual SQL queries cannot be cancelled mid-flight. A future debt-reduction WP should sweep all repositories and replace simple string-based Dapper calls with CommandDefinition(sql, param, cancellationToken: ct) to ensure cooperative cancellation through the full I/O path."
